# oracle: kspace_style ewald with the dielectric command (0.4255) on a periodic lj/cut/coul/long dimer; the G-ewald estimate and the kspace sum must follow native (the reference force is qqr2e, not qqrd2e)
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all abs=1e-9
units real
atom_style full
boundary p p p
region box block -50 50 -50 50 -50 50
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 single 0 0 0 units box
create_atoms 1 single 2.0 0 0 units box
mass * 1.0
set type 1 charge 0.5
pair_style lj/cut/coul/long 8.0
pair_coeff * * 0.0 1.0
dielectric 0.4255
kspace_style ewald 1.0e-4
thermo_style custom step pe evdwl ecoul elong
thermo_modify format float %.15g norm no
run 0
